{'symbol': 'CNC', 'date': '2022-10-17 07:00:00', 'title': 'AMBETTER HEALTH EXPANDS BENEFIT OFFERINGS AND GEOGRAPHIC FOOTPRINT IN 2023; ANNOUNCES REFRESHED BRAND NAME', 'text': "ST. LOUIS , OCT. 17, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AMBETTER HEALTH, CENTENE CORPORATION'S (NYSE: CNC) HEALTH INSURANCE MARKETPLACE CARRIER, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT WILL EXPAND INTO ALABAMA AND EXTEND ITS FOOTPRINT BY MORE THAN 60 COUNTIES ACROSS 12 EXISTING STATES IN 2023. THE COMPANY ALSO ANNOUNCED ITS UPDATED BRAND NAME, AMBETTER HEALTH, REFLECTING ITS COMMITMENT TO PUTTING BETTER HEALTH AT THE FOREFRONT OF ITS MISSION."}